sequenceDiagram
  participant APP as NativePHP prototype
  participant API as HIS Results API
  participant AUTH as Auth/Tenant
  participant DB as Results service
  APP->>AUTH: authenticate + select tenant
  AUTH-->>APP: short-lived token
  APP->>API: GET /api/v1/lab-results/pending
  API->>DB: query tenant-scoped pending results
  DB-->>API: results or timeout
  API-->>APP: 200 data + correlation_id
  APP->>API: POST /api/v1/lab-results/{id}/corrections
  API-->>APP: 201 version or 409 conflict
